      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.61,
      "end_seconds": 38.3,
      "duration_seconds": 7.69,
      "text": "I'd give it a seven out of ten. It happens a few times a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.75,
      "end_seconds": 44.68,
      "duration_seconds": 5.93,
      "text": "uh, I was just gonna say that the main thing is—"
    },
