      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.51,
      "end_seconds": 290.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "the the tongue looks smooth and red"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.08,
      "end_seconds": 295.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "please sit back down"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.22,
      "end_seconds": 321.88,
      "duration_seconds": 18.66,
      "text": "okay, so my impression is this: My working impression is symptoms that fit a vitamin B12 deficiency i can't rule out an under-active thyroid yet we shouldn't forget diabetic nerve damage i think a full blood count makes sense here, for tiredness"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 323.79,
      "end_seconds": 328.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "We have a slot Monday at 9 am, if that works."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 330.37,
      "end_seconds": 333.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "Monday that works for me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 333.7,
      "end_seconds": 344.47,
      "duration_seconds": 10.77,
      "text": "I'll request a vitamin B12 level, it'll help with tingling and tiredness. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 346.44,
      "end_seconds": 348.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "Is that done today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 349.62,
      "end_seconds": 369.27,
      "duration_seconds": 19.65,
      "text": "Let's use cyanocobalamin, 1000 micrograms, every other day, for two weeks. It's for low vitamin B12. Eating more eggs, dairy and fortified cereals will help over time. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 370.33,
      "end_seconds": 372.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "Okay, makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 373.89,
      "end_seconds": 393.0,
      "duration_seconds": 19.11,
      "text": "I'm not ordering a thyroid test today. If things carry on next month, we'll consider it. Do get help quickly if the symptoms get worse. See me again in two weeks. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 394.76,
      "end_seconds": 398.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "right, I'll do that. Thank you, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 400.62,
      "end_seconds": 402.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "Take care now."
